  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Strengthening of Mining Sector for Indigenous Peoples Inclusion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will support institutional strengthening for the Chilean Ministry of mining to increase the sustainability of the mining and geothermic sector by building mechanisms for partnership and cooperation between the Ministrycomma the private sector and Chile#s indigenous community.  The project will accomplish this by developing the capacity of the Chilean Ministry of Mining to: (i) integrate indigenous peoples# priorities into ministry policy and programscomma (ii) facilitate indigenous communities# participation in the development of mining and geothermal industriescomma (iii) increase dialogue between the private sector and the indigenous communities and (iv) monitor progress achieving these goals. The development objective of this proposal is to strengthen the sustainability of the mining sector by developing the capacity of the Chilean Ministry of Mining to (i) integrate indigenous peoples&apos; prioritiescomma (ii) strengthen the participation of indigenous communities in the development of mining and geothermal industriescomma (iii) increase dialogue between the private sector and the indigenous communities and (iv) monitor progress in achieving these goals.</narrative>
  </description>
